Interop test peer (interop/, not part of the module's packages)
---------------------------------------------------------------

The nested test-only module interop/ builds lib60870-C v2.4.1
(https://github.com/mz-automation/lib60870, Copyright MZ Automation GmbH,
GPLv3 or a commercial licence) with mbedtls 3.6.6 (Apache-2.0 or
GPL-2.0-or-later) and socat in a Docker container from their sources,
together with a peer program of ours (interop/peer/peer.c, Apache-2.0)
and lib60870's own example programs. lib60870 is used only as a test
peer: no lib60870 or mbedtls source is included in this repository,
nothing of it is linked into this module, and the container image is
built on the tester's machine and not distributed.

Test data
---------

Every key, certificate, address and point value in this module is a
made-up demo value; none belongs to a real installation.
